@startuml Complete Sequence Diagram - SmartBank Assistant User Journey
!theme plain

actor "User" as User
participant "Frontend\n(React)" as Frontend
participant "Backend API\n(FastAPI)" as Backend
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB
participant "Gemini AI\n(Google)" as AI

== User Registration & Login ==
User -> Frontend: 1. Register (name, email, password)
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/auth/register
Backend -> Backend: Validate email format
Backend -> Backend: Hash password (bcrypt)
Backend -> DB: INSERT INTO users
DB --> Backend: User created
Backend --> Frontend: 201 Created + User data
Frontend -> Frontend: Show success message
Frontend -> User: Redirect to login

User -> Frontend: 2. Login (email, password)
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/auth/login
Backend -> DB: SELECT user by email
DB --> Backend: User data
Backend -> Backend: Verify password (bcrypt)
Backend -> Backend: Generate JWT token
Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK + JWT token
Frontend -> Frontend: Store token in localStorage
Frontend -> User: Redirect to dashboard

== Account Management ==
User -> Frontend: 3. View accounts
Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/accounts\n(Authorization: Bearer JWT)
Backend -> Backend: Verify JWT token
Backend -> DB: SELECT accounts WHERE user_id
DB --> Backend: Account list
Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK + Accounts
Frontend -> User: Display accounts with balances

== Transaction Management ==
User -> Frontend: 4. Create transaction
Frontend -> Frontend: Validate form
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/transactions\n(Authorization: Bearer JWT)
Backend -> Backend: Verify JWT token
Backend -> Backend: Validate transaction data
Backend -> DB: SELECT account
DB --> Backend: Account data
Backend -> Backend: Check balance (if withdrawal)
Backend -> DB: INSERT transaction
Backend -> DB: UPDATE account balance
DB --> Backend: Transaction created
Backend --> Frontend: 201 Created + Transaction
Frontend -> User: Show success message

== AI Chatbot Interaction ==
User -> Frontend: 5. Send chat message\n"What's my balance?"
Frontend -> Backend: POST /api/chat/message\n(Authorization: Bearer JWT)
Backend -> Backend: Verify JWT token
Backend -> DB: INSERT chat log (user message)
Backend -> DB: SELECT user accounts
Backend -> DB: SELECT recent transactions
DB --> Backend: User context data
Backend -> Backend: Prepare context for AI
Backend -> AI: Send message + context\n(User accounts, transactions)
AI --> Backend: AI response + intent\n"Your total balance is $X"
Backend -> DB: UPDATE chat log (bot response)
Backend --> Frontend: Chat log with response
Frontend -> Frontend: Display message + response
Frontend -> User: Show conversation

== View Transaction History ==
User -> Frontend: 6. View transactions
Frontend -> Backend: GET /api/transactions\n(Authorization: Bearer JWT)
Backend -> Backend: Verify JWT token
Backend -> DB: SELECT transactions WHERE user_id
DB --> Backend: Transaction list
Backend --> Frontend: 200 OK + Transactions
Frontend -> User: Display transaction history

@enduml

